Package: ggbasket
Type: Package
Title: Story-Driven 'ggplot2' Graphics and Metrics for Basketball Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Loukas", "Theodosiou", email = "loukesio@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tidy metrics (possessions, ratings, four factors, inequality,
    shrunken shooting rates, shot value over expected) and 'ggplot2' graphics
    (NBA and FIBA/EuroLeague courts, hexagonal and zone shot charts, shooting
    curves with uncertainty, percentile fingerprints, Lorenz curves, assist
    networks, cluster profiles) for basketball box-score, shot and
    play-by-play data. Inspired by, and a redesign of, the analyses in
    Zuccolotto and Manisera (2020) "Basketball Data Science" and the
    'BasketballAnalyzeR' package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
